== Usage ==
The '''Enchantment Table''' can be used to add or remove [[Enchantments]] on items, including those applied via [[Enchanted Book]]s rather than the table, [[Stacking Enchantments]] and [[Endcap Upgrades]].

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*The maximum theoretically achievable Bookshelf Power was 480 with {{Item|Enchanted Bookshelf|amount=32}} blocks placed down. 
**However, there was no point in going above 20.
*On {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profiles, the '''Enchantment Table''' in the Hub used to have 2,147,483,647 Bookshelf Power.

